WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.458 --> 00:00:03.916
♪♪♪

00:00:03.916 --> 00:00:06.208
- Let the MVP race begin!

00:00:06.291 --> 00:00:07.208
- You don't blow me!

00:00:07.416 --> 00:00:08.666
- This thing honestly drives itself.

00:00:08.666 --> 00:00:10.333
- Yo, what up, fam? I'm mad fun to watch.

00:00:10.416 --> 00:00:12.708
- Mind if I party barge in?

00:00:12.833 --> 00:00:14.208
- Receivers can't win anyway!

00:00:14.208 --> 00:00:15.458
- This is straight-up just a cliff.

00:00:15.791 --> 00:00:16.458
- Guardrail, Mike!

00:00:16.666 --> 00:00:18.416
- You gotta cut me out of the narrative!

00:00:18.416 --> 00:00:21.541
Position players will never win MVP!

00:00:22.416 --> 00:00:22.916
- Huh?

00:00:23.208 --> 00:00:25.333
- Let’s go quarterbacks!
- We support YOU.

00:00:25.666 --> 00:00:26.291
- Get in, J.T.

00:00:26.291 --> 00:00:27.958
- Hey, Carson, want me to drive for you like normal?

00:00:28.583 --> 00:00:31.458
- Take the blue ball and continue living in the QB-friendly league.

00:00:31.666 --> 00:00:32.458
But take the red ball—

00:00:32.458 --> 00:00:33.791
- Oh, dang, he took them both.

00:00:33.791 --> 00:00:36.333
- [Derrick Henry:] So many carries…he IS the one.

00:00:39.416 --> 00:00:43.166
See, nine years ago, the QBs rose up and ensured that only they would win MVP.

00:00:43.416 --> 00:00:45.666
These people are trapped in delusions.

00:00:45.666 --> 00:00:47.291
- Not gonna lie, I’m barely following.

00:00:47.916 --> 00:00:50.166
- Never send a man to do a machine’s job.

00:00:50.416 --> 00:00:51.916
- Whoa, they recast Agent Brady?

00:00:51.916 --> 00:00:52.916
- That's so weird!

00:00:53.666 --> 00:00:54.583
- They took Henry out!

00:00:54.791 --> 00:00:55.791
- I used to be like them...

00:00:55.916 --> 00:00:58.833
But then they made me an MVP candidate, and I knew it was all fake.

00:00:59.041 --> 00:01:00.416
- That's it...I know the secret.

00:01:01.041 --> 00:01:02.916
No one is really playing well this year.

00:01:03.041 --> 00:01:05.208
- So the first half of the season just, like, doesn't matter?

00:01:05.208 --> 00:01:07.333
- Yeah, you can always just come back.
- People LOVE sequels.

00:01:07.791 --> 00:01:08.458
- Any weapons?

00:01:08.458 --> 00:01:10.041
- I AM a weapon!

00:01:10.333 --> 00:01:11.416
AHHHHHH!

00:01:12.416 --> 00:01:14.541
STOP SCRAMBLING AND TAKE A SACK.

00:01:14.833 --> 00:01:16.416
- Take me higher than I’ve ever been.

00:01:16.916 --> 00:01:17.458
- BOOM.

00:01:18.208 --> 00:01:19.041
- Yo, sup, fam?

00:01:19.208 --> 00:01:20.916
- We took it to slo-mo yet again to show you—

00:01:20.916 --> 00:01:23.083
OH, J,T, KNOWS HE'S IN SLOW-MO!

00:01:23.083 --> 00:01:23.458
- Oh, damn.

00:01:23.791 --> 00:01:25.291
- I see the holes in the Matrix now.

00:01:26.208 --> 00:01:28.041
- Of course THEY would never let me win.

00:01:29.041 --> 00:01:29.583
- I got it!

00:01:29.666 --> 00:01:31.875
- Nah, I'm taking us to the volcano.
[Coughing]

